  "body": "https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#response-class\n\n> If init's status member is either not in the range 200 to 599, inclusive, or is a null body status, throw a RangeError\n\nWhy are we not including 100-199 in valid status range (in HTTP there are 100 and 101 status codes defined)? If we include this, then we can simplify the condition and remove the \"null body status\" check here.\n",
